<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">PURSUANT TO U.S. FEDERAL TAX LAWS, YOU HAVE A DUTY TO PROVIDE THE APPLICABLE TYPE OF TAX CERTIFICATION FORM ISSUED BY THE U.S. INTERNAL REVENUE SERVICE
